  "description": "Mok-Hun, a passionate Omega whose countless relationships have all ended in failure. Not only is he deeply shocked by the news that the coworker he had a crush on is getting married, but he also ends up having a frantic one-night stand with an Alpha he’s just met, thanks to a sudden fling. Later, after receiving a message from Cheong-Seon, his one-night stand, he rushes over, worried, but to his surprise, Cheong-Seon casually makes a shocking (!) remark, saying, “It was such a great experience that I’ve never had anything like it since…”\n\n*“I… want to be with you.”\n\n“I don’t know… Mr. Cheong-Seon, a dominant Alpha on a completely different level from me…\"*\n\nWhy did he choose someone as ordinary as me?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
